---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Sliding Puzzle Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Sliding Puzzle by Kroma Digital.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span>
      <h1>Sliding Puzzle</h1>
      <p>Privacy Policy for the Sliding Puzzle Android application.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>Last updated: September 7, 2026</strong></p>

      <h2>1. About Sliding Puzzle</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle is an Android puzzle game developed and maintained by Kroma Digital.</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how information may be processed when you use the app, including information that may be processed by third-party services used by the app.</p>

      <h2>2. Account Registration</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle does not require users to create an account or directly provide a name, email address, phone number, postal address, or payment-card information in order to use the app.</p>

      <h2>3. App Data</h2>
      <p>Game settings, preferences, progress, or similar app data may be stored locally on the user's device.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not operate a server for collecting or storing this local game data.</p>
      <p>Deleting the app or clearing its application data may remove locally stored information.</p>

      <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle uses Google AdMob through the Google Mobile Ads SDK and may display banner and interstitial advertisements.</p>
      <p>Google and its advertising services may process certain technical information as necessary to provide, secure, measure, and improve advertising services.</p>
      <p>Depending on the Google Mobile Ads SDK configuration, device settings, region, and applicable platform requirements, this information may include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address, which may be used to estimate general location;</li>
        <li>device and app information;</li>
        <li>advertising identifiers or similar identifiers, where permitted and applicable;</li>
        <li>information about interactions with the app or advertisements; and</li>
        <li>diagnostic and performance information.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not sell users' personal information.</p>

      <h2>5. Notifications</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle may request permission to send notifications on supported Android versions.</p>
      <p>The app also declares permission to receive the device boot-completed event. These permissions may be used by app features that provide or restore reminders or notifications when such features are enabled.</p>
      <p>Users can control notification permission through Android device settings.</p>

      <h2>6. Network Access</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle uses internet and network-state permissions primarily to support advertising and related online services.</p>
      <p>The app does not require precise GPS location, camera access, microphone access, or contact access for its current core gameplay.</p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle uses services provided by Google, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google AdMob;</li>
        <li>Google Mobile Ads SDK; and</li>
        <li>Google Play services and Android platform services as applicable.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These services may process information according to their own privacy policies and applicable settings.</p>
      <p>Google's Privacy Policy is available at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>
      <p>Information about how Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services is available at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</p>

      <h2>8. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not sell users' personal information.</p>
      <p>Technical information may be processed by Google or other service providers used by the app where necessary to provide advertising, security, diagnostics, distribution, or related functionality, subject to their respective privacy practices and the configuration of those services.</p>

      <h2>9. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Data stored locally by Sliding Puzzle generally remains on the user's device until it is deleted by the user, cleared through application data controls, or removed when the app is uninstalled, depending on Android device and operating system behavior.</p>
      <p>Information processed independently by Google or other platform services is subject to the retention practices of those service providers.</p>

      <h2>10. Security</h2>
      <p>Kroma Digital takes reasonable measures to minimize unnecessary collection of information and to limit the app's use of personal information.</p>
      <p>However, no electronic system, device, or network transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

      <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Sliding Puzzle does not require a user to create an online account or directly submit a name, email address, phone number, precise location, photographs, contacts, or account credentials in order to use the app.</p>
      <p>If the app is made available to children, advertising and third-party services should be configured in accordance with applicable child-directed requirements, Google Play policies, and legal obligations.</p>
      <p>Parents and guardians are encouraged to review the app and its Google Play listing before allowing a child to use it.</p>

      <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated if Sliding Puzzle's features, advertising, SDKs, permissions, storage, data practices, or applicable legal and platform requirements change.</p>
      <p>Any updated version will be published on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>

      <h2>13. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or Sliding Puzzle's privacy practices, please contact Kroma Digital at <a href="mailto:kromadigital.apps@gmail.com">kromadigital.apps@gmail.com</a> or through the <a href="/contact">Kroma Digital Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
